# Repository text is LF (see .editorconfig); `dotnet format` and Prettier enforce it. Normalizing here keeps Windows
# checkouts (core.autocrlf) from producing CRLF files that fail the format checks in CI.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.docx binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
